            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nWhat you are seeing in 'mini.completion' screenshot is the fallback builtin completion. By default it is the same as pressing `<C-n>` without completion engine. You can try other keys (see `:h ins-completion`) in `fallback_action` config setting. I would assume that `'<C-p>'` should work in this case, but it doesn't seem like it. So not sure how to make it happen here (apart from relying on LSP server for more proper suggestions).\r\n\r\nOther than built-in completion or fully user-defined function fully responsible for showing completion menu, nothing else is allowed in ",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What you are seeing in 'mini.completion' screenshot is the fallback builtin completion. By default it is the same as pressing <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-n&gt;</code> without completion engine. You can try other keys (see <code class=\"notranslate\">:h ins-completion</code>) in <code class=\"notranslate\">fallback_action</code> config setting. I would assume that <code class=\"notranslate\">'&lt;C-p&gt;'</code> should work in this case, but it doesn't seem like it. So not sure how to make it happen here (apart from relying on LSP server for more proper suggestions).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Other than built-in completion or fully user-defined function fully responsible for showing completion menu, nothing else is allowed in</p>",
            "bodyText": "Hi!\nWhat you are seeing in 'mini.completion' screenshot is the fallback builtin completion. By default it is the same as pressing <C-n> without completion engine. You can try other keys (see :h ins-completion) in fallback_action config setting. I would assume that '<C-p>' should work in this case, but it doesn't seem like it. So not sure how to make it happen here (apart from relying on LSP server for more proper suggestions).\nOther than built-in completion or fully user-defined function fully responsible for showing completion menu, nothing else is allowed in",
